                <head>Proclamation by President Roosevelt regarding the allocation of tariff quota
                    on crude petroleum and fuel oil to Venezuela</head>
                <p>[For text of proclamation issued December 26, 1941, pursuant to article VII of
                    the reciprocal trade agreement between the United States and Venezuela, signed
                    November 6, 1939, see Department of State Executive Agreement Series No. 226, or
                    55 Stat. (pt. 2) 1393.]</p>
